        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎃 Meat is Murder 🍽️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Taste of Terror at La Maison du Manger de Madame Malacarne</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the most exclusive restaurant in Fromageham, UK, where the chandeliers glint like spotlights, the silverware sings, and something sinister stalks the kitchen. The Green Reaper! Cloaked in emerald velvet, carrying a carving knife instead of a scythe, and wearing a jack-o'-lantern grin that flickers in the dark. No one knows what... or who... lies beneath that pumpkin mask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But here's the twist: in this restaurant, meat means survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat meat to heal your wounds...  but every bite makes the Green Reaper faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you starve in fear, or feast yourself into a massacre?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, Lottie LeHottie, aspiring actress and waitress, has just arrived for her first shift. A shadow flickers? &quot;Oooh, cinematic lighting!&quot; A floorboard creaks? &quot;Perfect for my close-up!&quot; Patrons scream? &quot;Ah, method acting!&quot; To her, the terror is just part of the show... a whimsical stage for her boundless optimism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍖 Barry Bacon...  The Butcher</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master of the cleaver, king of the carving block, and proud owner of the city's most &quot;hands-on&quot; handshake. His motto: &quot;Respect the meat or meet the blade.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍰 Lara L'Oeuf...  The Pastry Princess</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sugary smile, soulless heart. Every tart a work of art... and every colleague a critic she's ready to torch. Her desserts were sweet, but her temper? Pure brûlée.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔪 Phillippe Filet...  The Golden Boy Sous Chef</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knife prodigy, showboat, and the poster boy of fine dining. He believed the kitchen was war, and he was born to win... until someone else carved the victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍷 Marlin Merlot...  The Sommelier</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wine snob extraordinaire. His nose could detect &quot;notes of oak, despair, and mediocrity.&quot; He swirled, he sniffed, he sneered... and one night, he never resurfaced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👩‍🍳 Madame Malacarne...  The Head Chef</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The matriarch of meat and mistress of misery. Her kitchen ran on fear, sweat, and blood... and she liked it that way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 &quot;Bon appétit... or bon voyage.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Meat Is Murder, every chef gets their just desserts... and every meal might be your last.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎃 Meat is Murder 🍽️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Taste of Terror at La Maison du Manger de Madame Malacarne</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the most exclusive restaurant in Fromageham, UK, where the chandeliers glint like spotlights, the silverware sings, and something sinister stalks the kitchen. The Green Reaper! Cloaked in emerald velvet, carrying a carving knife instead of a scythe, and wearing a jack-o'-lantern grin that flickers in the dark. No one knows what... or who... lies beneath that pumpkin mask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But here's the twist: in this restaurant, meat means survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat meat to heal your wounds...  but every bite makes the Green Reaper faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you starve in fear, or feast yourself into a massacre?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, Lottie LeHottie, aspiring actress and waitress, has just arrived for her first shift. A shadow flickers? &quot;Oooh, cinematic lighting!&quot; A floorboard creaks? &quot;Perfect for my close-up!&quot; Patrons scream? &quot;Ah, method acting!&quot; To her, the terror is just part of the show... a whimsical stage for her boundless optimism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍖 Barry Bacon...  The Butcher</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master of the cleaver, king of the carving block, and proud owner of the city's most &quot;hands-on&quot; handshake. His motto: &quot;Respect the meat or meet the blade.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍰 Lara L'Oeuf...  The Pastry Princess</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sugary smile, soulless heart. Every tart a work of art... and every colleague a critic she's ready to torch. Her desserts were sweet, but her temper? Pure brûlée.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔪 Phillippe Filet...  The Golden Boy Sous Chef</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knife prodigy, showboat, and the poster boy of fine dining. He believed the kitchen was war, and he was born to win... until someone else carved the victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍷 Marlin Merlot...  The Sommelier</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wine snob extraordinaire. His nose could detect &quot;notes of oak, despair, and mediocrity.&quot; He swirled, he sniffed, he sneered... and one night, he never resurfaced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👩‍🍳 Madame Malacarne...  The Head Chef</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The matriarch of meat and mistress of misery. Her kitchen ran on fear, sweat, and blood... and she liked it that way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 &quot;Bon appétit... or bon voyage.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Meat Is Murder, every chef gets their just desserts... and every meal might be your last.</p>",
